---
title: "Postup lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: visiting / live
  s1: hosting / live
  s2: visiting / ended
  s3: visiting / cancelled
  s4: visiting / full
  s5: hosting / cancelled
  s6: hosting / ended
  s7: hosting / full
  s8: joined / live
  s9: joined / cancelled
  s10: joined / ended
  s11: joined / full
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  [*] --> s2
  s0 --> s3: it is cancelled
  s0 --> s2: time runs out
  s0 --> s4: it fills up
  s0 --> s8: you join
  s1 --> s5: it is cancelled
  s1 --> s6: the host ends it now or time runs out
  s1 --> s7: it fills up
  s4 --> s3: it is cancelled
  s4 --> s2: time runs out
  s7 --> s5: it is cancelled
  s7 --> s6: the host ends it now or time runs out
  s8 --> s0: you leave
  s8 --> s9: it is cancelled
  s8 --> s10: time runs out
  s8 --> s11: it fills up
  s11 --> s4: you leave
  s11 --> s9: it is cancelled
  s11 --> s10: time runs out
